--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.R6IL3Cost`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem IntMul.Kappa.R6.IL3H.cost_fixGH {W A m Bn t S0 r Z H F x : ℕ} (hW : 1 ≤ W) (hS : 1 ≤ S0) (hBn : 1 ≤ Bn)
